caption: Mastery Unlocks
tradition-component: mastery-unlocks

Mastering High Magic unlocks its three Embodiment Path families. A mastered High Mage may eventually possess one Aspect Embodiment, one Elemental Embodiment, and one Animal Embodiment, subject to the prerequisites and mutual exclusivity within each family.
